\",\"snippet\":\" ... 1) studies that situate Wikipedia as a health information resource; 2) investigations into the quality of Wikipedia, 3) explorations of the utility of Wikipedia in education, and 4) studies that demonstrate the utility of Wikipedia in research.\\n\\nConclusion\\n\\nThe literature positions Wikipedia as a prominent health information resource ... \",\"title\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7028268/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"4d96b38e70a456d3b757b4cc44c2a0c8cb09b8895735251bd6fc7959120a9e99\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"353ffbdf642b6e4668ae8a501f8dd6bd475795f9380b55d53c8678c23877fddb\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Jokha Alharthi Wikipedia\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d73\"},\"ref\":\"d73\",\"snippet\":\" ... Maria Gainza is sharp, modern and playful, a writer who multiplies the possibilities for fiction.\\\"\\n\\n–Johanna Thomas-Corr (The Guardian)\\n\\n10. Bitter Orange Tree by Jokha Alharthi, trans. by Marilyn Booth\\n\\n(Catapult)\\n\\n7 Rave • 6 Positive • 3 Mixed\\n\\nListen to an excerpt from Bitter Orange Tree here\\n\\n\\\"Beautifully ... \",\"title\":\"https://lithub.com/the-best-reviewed-literature-in-translation-of-2022/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d72\"},\"ref\":\"d72\",\"snippet\":\" ... Marilyn Booth (Catapult, Simon & Schuster)\\n\\nFrom the publisher: \\\"From Man Booker International Prize–winning author Jokha Alharthi, Bitter Orange Tree is a profound exploration of social status, wealth, desire, and female agency. It presents a mos