ed\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d114\"},\"ref\":\"d114\",\"snippet\":\" ... Assess the level of marital happiness among Omani couples.\\n\\n-\\n\\n2.\\n\\nInvestigate the factors that could contribute to marital happiness among Omani couples.\\n\\nSpecifically, this study aimed to answer the following questions:\\n\\n-\\n\\n1.\\n\\nWhat is the level of marital happiness among Omani couples?\\n\\n-\\n\\n2.\\n\\nAre there any significant differences ... \",\"title\":\"https://bmcpsychology.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/s40359-024-02232-4\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d113\"},\"ref\":\"d113\",\"snippet\":\" ... The fort was subject to an epic two-year siege from 1696 to 1698 by the Omani Arabs, led by Saif bin Sultan. The capture of the fort marked the end of Portuguese presence on the coast, although they briefly captured and re-occupied it between 1728 and ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Jesus\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d96\"},\"ref\":\"d96\",\"snippet\":\" ... Believed to have been built in 1507 CE and then bolstered with towers and stronger walls by the Portuguese during their occupation of Oman in the 1560s, the fort eventually returned to Omani control in the 17th century, and historically served as a significant part of a larger ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.mei.edu/publications/many-lives-omans-forts\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"62eaaabadd94ef3a42ff9ab2061548021a6b5d6e7cb8d8a07adcb12d8fab6fa7\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"5a3735321656202b49120e593859c712d57ddf6244b0182d50ece17a7bd50d82